{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"43ae9327f3a9401b8ec950d5d27f64f048bbd7ac8d6d42e14967d229e27fd011","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["羊群必遭殺戮"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["黎巴嫩啊，打開你的門吧，",{"text":"好讓火焰吞噬你的香柏樹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"松樹啊，哀號吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為香柏樹已經倒下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挺拔的樹木已被毀壞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊的橡樹啊，哀號吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為茂密的樹林已被砍倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽啊，牧人在哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們肥美的草場已被毀壞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽啊，獅子在吼叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為約旦河畔的叢林已被毀壞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我的上帝耶和華說：「你去牧養這群待宰的羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["買羊的宰羊卻不受懲罰，賣羊的說，『耶和華當受稱頌！我發財了。』牠們的牧人毫不憐憫牠們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我不再憐憫這地方的居民，我要使他們落在鄰人及其君王手中，任這地方被摧毀，必不從敵人手中拯救他們。這是耶和華說的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["於是，我牧養這群最困苦的待宰之羊。我拿了兩根杖，一根叫「恩惠」，一根叫「聯合」，開始牧養這群羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我在一個月之內除掉了三個牧人。 我厭煩羊群，他們也厭惡我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["於是我說：「我不再牧養你們了。要死的就死吧，要亡的就亡吧，讓剩下的互相吞吃吧。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["然後，我拿起那根叫「恩惠」的杖，把它折斷，以廢除我與萬民所立的約。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["約就在當天廢除了，那些注視著我的困苦羊便知道這是上帝的話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我對他們說：「你們若認為好，就給我工錢，不然就算了。」於是，他們給了我三十塊銀子作工錢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["耶和華對我說：「把這一大筆錢丟給窯戶吧，這就是我在他們眼中的價值！」我便把三十塊銀子丟給聖殿中的窯戶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我又把那根叫「聯合」的杖折斷，以斷開猶大和以色列之間的手足之情。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["耶和華又對我說：「你再拿起愚昧牧人的器具，"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["因為我要使一位牧人在地上興起，他不照顧喪亡的，不尋找失散的，不醫治受傷的，不牧養健壯的，反而吃肥羊的肉，撕掉牠們的蹄子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"「丟棄羊群的無用牧人有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願刀砍在他的臂膀和右眼上！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他的臂膀徹底枯槁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的右眼完全失明！」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}